### ITC Vendor Portal API Tests
### Make sure the CAP server is running (npx cds watch)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004
@vendor1Auth = Authorization: Basic vendor1:vendor1
@admin1Auth = Authorization: Basic admin1:admin1

### =========================================
### VENDOR API TESTS
### =========================================

### 1. Get Vendor Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/MyProfile
{{vendor1Auth}}

### 2. Get Vendor Divisions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/MyDivisions
{{vendor1Auth}}

### 3. Get ASN List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/ShippingNotifications
{{vendor1Auth}}

### 4. Create an ASN (Advanced Shipping Notification)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/ShippingNotifications
{{vendor1Auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poNumber": "4500001234",
  "shipmentDate": "2023-10-15",
  "expectedDelivery": "2023-10-20",
  "carrierName": "FedEx",
  "vehicleNumber": "MH01AB1234",
  "division_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000001",
  "items": [
    {
      "lineNumber": 10,
      "poItemNumber": "00010",
      "materialNumber": "MAT-123",
      "shippedQuantity": 100,
      "uom": "EA"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Get Payment Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vendor/getPaymentSummary(divisionId=a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000001)
{{vendor1Auth}}

### =========================================
### ADMIN API TESTS
### =========================================

### 1. List All Vendors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/Vendors
{{admin1Auth}}

### 2. List Document Approvals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/Documents
{{admin1Auth}}

### 3. Test SAP Connectivity
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/testConnection
{{admin1Auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### =========================================
### INTEGRATION API TESTS
### =========================================

### 1. Test Workflow Callback (Simulate BPA Approval)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integration/workflowCallback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowInstanceId": "wf-instance-123",
  "decision": "approve",
  "comment": "Approved by Line Manager",
  "approverEmail": "approver@itc.in"
}

### 2. Register new Vendor (Public API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register/VendorRegistrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "panNumber": "TEST1234T",
  "vendorName": "New Test Vendor",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "phone": "9999999999",
  "requestedDivisions": "FMCG, HOTELS"
}
